{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=member_2","headline":"雨过石湖 · 若蘅","name":"雨过石湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一雨湖天净，云开霁色新。\n水光摇岸柳，山影落舟人。\n野阔菰蒲静，风清鸥鹭亲。\n凭栏成独往，不觉暮烟匀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"若蘅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/member_2.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=member_2","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五律","abstract":"收录于选自《石湖诗社社课习作》（2024）","citation":"若蘅自注"}